        "text": "🚨 𝐔𝐫𝐠𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐂𝐚𝐥𝐥 𝐅𝐨𝐫 𝐇𝐞𝐥𝐩 🚨\n\nOver 1,100 families in 𝐇𝐚𝐩𝐩𝐲𝐥𝐚𝐧𝐝, 𝐓𝐨𝐧𝐝𝐨 lost their homes in the September 13 fire. Many are now in evacuation centers with little more than the clothes on their backs.\n\nTo help, Team Will International members have pledged ₱15,000 for a 𝐌𝐚𝐭𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐧𝐠𝐞! That means every peso you give will be matched peso-for-peso until we reach the 15K goal.\n\nAll donations will go directly to 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐣𝐞𝐜𝐭 𝐏𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐥𝐬, providing food, water, clothing, and shelter support to fire victims. Together, we can double our impact and bring urgent relief to families who need it most.\n\n📌Please post the receipt under this thread. Thank you!",
